  data: {
    LLM: 'The Pedro (5 of trumps) and Low Pedro (other 5 of same color) are worth 10 points togetherâ€”more than half the available points. Prioritize capturing or protecting these cards.\n\nWhen bidding, consider not just your trumps but whether you have protection in side suits. A hand with the two Pedros and a few other trumps is strong even without the Ace or King.\n\nThe King of trumps adds 5 points, making it as valuable as a Pedro. If you hold the King and several other trumps, you have a strong hand for bidding. Watch for situations where you can force opponents to play their Pedros by leading high trumps.',
